WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
The prerequisite Arc-Step kick knocks Ryu down.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.850
Kimberly Rushes toward the waking Ryu.

3
00:00:00.850 --> 00:00:01.150
The standing light punch intentionally misses before the retreat.

4
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.600
Ryu’s throw attempt misses the retreating Kimberly.

5
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:04.850
Standing heavy punch punishes the whiff.

6
00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:05.200
The run-stop heavy-kick target route finishes with Sprint slide.

7
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.850
Ryu falls after the completed punish.
